# MCP_FLINK_CALLER_CREDENTIALS_FILE — per-caller outbound Flink auth (O2 phase B)
# Format: callerId : flinkAuthHeader : gatewayAuthHeader
# Use "-" to fall back to MCP_FLINK_REST_AUTH_HEADER / MCP_FLINK_GATEWAY_AUTH_HEADER.
#
# Values are sent as the HTTP Authorization header to Flink REST / SQL Gateway.
# Prefer "Bearer <token>" or "Basic <base64(user:pass)>" matching your cluster.
#
# alice : Bearer alice-flink-token : Bearer alice-gateway-token
# bob   : Basic Ym9iOnNlY3JldA== : -
